 calculate the $x$-intercept, we need to substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the ellipse and solve the resulting equation for $x.$ Doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{(y+3)^{2}}{12} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{(0+3)^{2}}{12} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{9}{12} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{3}{4} & =1 \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+12 & =16 \\\\ (x-2)^{2} & =4 \\\\ x-2 & =\\pm 2 \\\\ x & =2\\pm 2 \\\\ x & =0,4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395877 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395878 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395877 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395879 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395877 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395880 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395877 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395881 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395877 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395882 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395877 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395877 1077 "selection" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395877 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395880 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395877 1080 #uuid "384638bd-72a6-5df4-a17b-400ec33ad1b3" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395878 1081 "(\\pm 3,0)" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395878 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395878 1084 #uuid "02fe5fe7-b348-53e0-8947-15f0c37ed27c" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395879 1081 "(\\pm 2,0)" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395879 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395879 1084 #uuid "2b6bcede-bd93-5e91-b587-867ae663acd1" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395880 1081 "$(0,0)$ and $(4,0)$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395880 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395880 1084 #uuid "6d0fc8b9-a163-539b-9c0f-8eb06fff83e1" 1319413953