 & =\\frac{p+\\text{i}q}{2\\text{i}} \\\\ 2\\text{i}(-3-2\\text{i}) & =p+\\text{i}q \\\\ -6\\text{i}-4{\\text{i}}^{2} & =p+\\text{i}q \\\\ 4-6\\text{i} & =p+\\text{i}q\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can equate the real parts and the imaginary parts separately.\n\n- Equating the real parts, we get\n\n$$\n4=p.\n$$\n\n- Equating the imaginary parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-6 & =q.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $p=4$ and $q=-6.$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395940 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395941 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395942 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395943 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395944 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1077 "selection" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395940 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395939 1080 #uuid "a244a31a-a197-5f00-a4e9-0789e9701cad" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395940 1081 "$p=4$, $q=-6$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395940 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395940 1084 #uuid "ea8dceb1-70ef-5b3f-9be1-4054c67c27ad" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395941 1081 "$p=-4$, $q=-6$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395941 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395941 1084 #uuid "f9c3d72a-e3e2-5b15-805c-281c715443c5" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395942 1081 "$p=2$, $q=-3$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395942 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395942 1084 #uuid "a89a7c87-829a-57da-9854-e45cadac30dc" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395943 1081