+0+0 \\\\  & =k(3k-6)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the matrix is singular, the determinant is $0.$ So,  we have:\n\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}k(3k-6) & =0 \\\\ 3k(k-2) & =0 \\\\ k & =0,2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $k=0$ and $k=2.$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395973 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395974 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395973 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395975 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395973 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395976 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395973 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395977 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395973 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395978 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395973 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395973 1077 "selection" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395973 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395977 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395973 1080 #uuid "0631763f-bf07-54e2-9810-4d0b16208a88" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395974 1081 "$-2$ and $2$ only" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395974 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395974 1084 #uuid "48ffa317-1b68-57e4-8682-58b3f2cf3610" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395975 1081 "$0$ only" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395975 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395975 1084 #uuid "43dbf530-ae59-578a-b191-6ba7d2edf47b" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395976 1081 "$-2$ and $0$ only" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395976 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395976 1084 #uuid "c1c887a0-8c33-5ac9-b8f5-287ee0622dd9" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395977 1081 "$0$ and $2$ only" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395977 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395977 1084 #uuid "0a134bc9-3211-56a8